=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Ponono (A)} at (H-7) in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa}.
** This location is at Veridical Conflux #08. If you have not gone to this location yet, you need to speak to {p:Red Ghost (A)} who will teleport you above the ledge.
